Ultimately, if we are unable to supply our cell therapy product candidates to meet commercial demand, were commercial approval to be obtained,
whether because of processing constraints or other disruptions, delays or difficulties that we experience, our production costs could increase dramatically, and
sales of the product and its long-term commercial prospects could be significantly damaged.
